SUMMARY:⬛ UT Austin · Start here · Color the classes\, delete extra s
 ections
DESCRIPTION:This calendar was built from your Fall 2026 syllabi.\n\nColor
  in Outlook\, one time: open any event\, choose Categorize\, and set\nARE
  102 = blue\, ARE 217 = purple\, CE 311K = orange\, CE 311S = green\, EM 
 306 = red\, ME 310T = yellow\, UT Austin = dark gray.\nThe colored square
  in the title already shows the class before you do that.\nThe word after
  the square is the activity: Lecture\, Exam\, Quiz\, HW due\, Lab\, Studi
 o\, Office hours\, Reading due\, Project due.\nSearch the calendar for Ex
 am or HW due when you only want those.\n\nDelete the sections that are no
 t yours. Open one event and delete the series:\nCE 311K labs: 17605 Fri 1
 2–2\, 17610 Fri 2–4\, 17615 Wed 3–5\, 17620 Tue 4–6. All in ECJ 2
 .210.\nCE 311S Monday labs in ECJ 2.218: 17645 1–2\, 17655 2–3\, 1766
 0 3–4\, 17650 4–5. Confirm the unique number on your registration\; t
 he two syllabi list them in different orders. A separate all-day event ea
 ch Monday names that week's lab or review. Keep that one.\nEM 306 discuss
 ions: 16220 Mon 4–6 CPE 2.220\, 16225 Tue 4–6 ECJ 1.314\, 16230 Mon 6
 –8 ECJ 1.314\, 16235 Tue 6–8 ECJ 1.314.\nEM 306 evening exams are lis
 ted twice (4–6 and 6–8). Delete the seating that is not yours after C
 anvas posts rooms.\nARE 217 studios in ECJ 3.106: 17445 MW 8–10\, 17450
  MW 10–12\, 17455 MW 3–5\, 17460 MW 5–7. The PDF header says Fall 2
 027. Delete all four if you are not in it this fall.\n\nOffice hours and 
 optional recitations are marked free\, so they show up but do not block y
 our day\, and they do not alarm.\n\nES 333T was pasted without a course s
 chedule\, meeting time\, or due dates. Nothing from that course is on thi
 s calendar. Send the schedule page if you want it added.\n\nNot dated in 
 the syllabi\, so not invented here: CE 311K homework\, CE 311S homework\,
  EM 306 homework (typically assigned Wednesday and due the next Friday)\,
  ARE 217 assignments\, and the CE 311S final exam time.\n\nConfirm these 
 conflicts in the syllabi before you trust them:\nARE 102 Project 1 is Oct
 ober 2 in one place and October 28 in another.\nCE 311K Midterm 2 names T
 hursday\, November 19\, but not the clock time. It is placed in the regul
 ar 8:00 am class.\nME 310T homework is placed at Friday 9:00 pm\, which i
 s the written rule. The schedule table shows each homework on the Thursda
 y row.
