 s lists unique numbers 17645\, 17650\, 17655\, and 17660. The lab syllabu
 s pairs 17645\, 17655\, 17660\, and 17650 with 1–2\, 2–3\, 3–4\, an
 d 4–5. Confirm your registration.\nAttendance is mandatory. Email befor
 e lab if you will miss it\, or that lab is a zero.\nNo lab is dropped. La
 bs are 5% of the grade.\nBring a laptop and a printed lab report. Excel i
 s required. One hard-copy report per pair.\nThe lab syllabus says finish 
 during the 50 minutes or turn the report in by midnight that Monday. The 
 lecture syllabus says within 7 days. Use midnight unless the TA says othe
 rwise.\n\n\nAug 24: Lab 0 — Calculus review.\nAug 31: Lab 1 — Probabi
 lity in lifeline design.\nSep 14: Review — Exam 1 review.\nSep 21: Lab 
