 bor costs.\nOct 5: Review — Exam 2 review.\nOct 12: Lab 4 — Levee des
 ign\, normal distribution.\nOct 19: Lab 5 — Hydraulic conductivity\, lo
 gnormal.\nOct 26: Lab 6 — Column reliability.\nNov 2: Review — Exam 3
  review.\nNov 9: Lab 7 — Mercury emission intervals.\nNov 16: Review 
 — Exam 4 review.\nNov 30: Lab 8 — Income regression.\nDec 7: Review 
 — Final exam review.
